---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { t } from "../lib/i18n";
const ui = t("en");
---
<Base lang="en" title={ui.aboutTitle} description={ui.disclaimer} path="/about">
  <div class="wrap wrap-narrow" style="padding:1.4rem 0 2.5rem">
    <p class="kicker">{ui.siteKicker}</p>
    <h1>{ui.aboutTitle}</h1>
    <p class="dek">A public reference for mortgage origination, underwriting, disclosure, and servicing. The working title is Mortgage Compliance Glossary.</p>
    <h2>How to read an entry</h2>
    <p>The plain-English definition is always first. Professional view, the default, then keeps the regulation detail, the form or file example, the compliance note, and the citations open. Borrower view leads with the definition and the example and collapses the professional sections. The control is in the header and is remembered on this browser.</p>
    <p>Sample dollar amounts are marked “Example figures.” They are not rates, limits, or current official thresholds. Loan limits, HOEPA and qualified-mortgage dollar breakpoints, FHA mortgage insurance, and the VA funding fee change and are cited rather than copied.</p>
    <h2>{ui.authorTitle}</h2>
    <p>{ui.authorBody}</p>
    <h2>Spanish</h2>
    <p lang="es">{ui.spanishNote}</p>
    <h2>{ui.disclaimerTitle}</h2>
    <p>{ui.disclaimer}</p>
  </div>
</Base>
